      "claim": "unitWear instance: consuming forms more at step 1, total stops at budget 6, sustained reaches 14 by step 7",
      "kernel_checked": true,
      "counted_as_new_theorem": false
    },
    {
      "claim": "unitWear joint instance: two parts at rate 2 jointly form the budget 3 and then nothing; one part alone forms 10 by step 5",
      "kernel_checked": true,
